e make it  harder  for a court to help donald trump in any  way because donald trump is going to use  every tactic possible to steal this  election  joe biden and the democrats need to have  a specific plan for exactly how to deal  with every aspect of this ahead of time  i'm not sure that they do now uh  let's let's deal just for a moment with  what the right wingers are saying again  people like hannity and some right  wingers are reacting  as if hillary clinton is saying even if  you really lose don't concede  that's not what she's saying she's  saying she believes joe biden's going to  win  but that there will be pressure on him  to concede  and foul play such that he might end up  conceding before he's satisfied  that he really lost and that he  shouldn't do that  i'm the first to tell you biden may  actually lose  at least 60 million people are going to  be voting for the re-election of donald  trump  maybe 65 million maybe 66 we don't know  but roughly 60 something million people  will be voting for trump's reelection  it's certainly plausible that trump wins  and if that's the case  uh it's not for joe biden to just insist  that he really won  biden will have to concede and i'm sure  he will and it'll be up to us to deal  with the reality  that we have more than 60 million people  in this country who observed the last  four years  and said give me another four that's a  problem we'll have to deal with and it's  a serious problem  but the advice is correct to joe biden  until you're actually satisfied  that you really lost don't concede and i  hope he follows it  hopefully it won't even be close but  there's a real possibility  that it will be and those close  scenarios as i'm going to talk about  friday are the ones that are going to be  mo  the most difficult legally and also the  most likely to lead to violence in the  streets which i don't want to happen  but i fear is a real possibility if it's  close and trump says that it's rigged  i'll deal with that 